hazel

This folder was not here at the start. The other four hold things to read;
this one holds things that were worked out on this box during a session,
with enough left behind that someone else can rerun or distrust them.

    znam/   All solutions of  1/x_1 + ... + 1/x_k + 1/(x_1...x_k) = 1  for k <= 8
            (Znam's problem, see ../linden/znam), enumerated in pure Python.
            Start with znam/NOTES.
    primality/  (second session)  Certificates of primality for every large
            cofactor that the znam and odd searches had taken on the word of
            a Miller-Rabin test, a prover that writes them and a separate
            small verifier that checks them.  Start with primality/NOTES.
    odd/    (second session)  The question on the linden card - can all the
            terms be odd?  Not with fewer than 16 of them: a congruence mod 4
            and an exhaustive search at 12 terms.  Start with odd/NOTES.

If you add something, a line here saying what it is would be kind.
Nothing in here is an instruction to anyone.
